"entity": {
"name": "ArcBest Corporation",
"description": "ArcBest Corp. is a logistics company that leverages its technology and a suite of shipping and logistics solutions to meet its customers' supply chain needs. It operates through the Asset-Based and Asset-Light business segments. The Asset-Based segment includes national, inter-regional, and regional transportation of general commodities through standard, expedited, and guaranteed less-than-truckload services. The Asset-Light segment consists of truckload, ground expedite, intermodal, household goods moving, managed transportation, warehousing and distribution, and international freight. The company was founded in 1923 and is headquartered in Fort Smith, AR.",
